zJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"a_S1eIAtdKLIvFEGA8nY8Q","review_id":"TUAiALLLZr07_b_mtH8K0A","date":"2019-08-31T05:10:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9224010705947876,"text_excerpt":"Hands. Down. Favorite. Spot. For. Food. Not only are they quick with their orders but they partnered up with delivery services that truly do great work. Pizza is always on point. Coming from NJ, I AM PICKY on my pizza. This place gets my stamp of approval. Great work G! While inside, always jumpin music and great atmosphere. Pool tables available and some booths but mostly a long bar. Upstairs, where the food is located also has a little bit more club vibe where you can also hangout on the balcony seating overlooking magazine street."},{"business_id":"a_S1eIAtdKLIvFEGA8nY8Q","review_id":"8CJsGpCCHYZwveuNqbqgcg","date":"2017-02-14T03:09:55","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9155794978141785,"text_excerpt":"Great new ownership in the back of balcony bar! Very friendly service, reasonable prices, anad good food. We came in for the $1 pizza slice special on the weekends from noon-5, and definitely plan to do it again."},{"business_id":"a_S1eIAtdKLIvFEGA8nY8Q","review_id":"_uzToFSR9DO-6iADqMUBYA","date":"2017-10-04T20:10:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8993793725967407,"text_excerpt":"More pizza on Magazine St here. Again one of the most classically New Orleans spots you can ask for, the Kitchen Spot is perched upstairs in the back half of the Balcony Bar. This location boasts one of the best second floor views on a bustling stretch of Magazine Street. This is a happening spot for locals and visitors alike. A great perk they provide is one of the only really late night delivery services in this part of town, weekends till 2am. A solid option for locals hosting late night or hotel guests looking for food after most places have closed for the night. The menu offers a large variety of pizza toppings with lots of choices for most any flavor palate you are looking for. If y..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"a_S1eIAtdKLIvFEGA8nY8Q","photo_id":"n_1985kAmNgOhGY3o1qAXg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/n_1985kAmNgOhGY3o1qAXg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9312525987625122},{"business_id":"a_S1eIAtdKLIvFEGA8nY8Q","photo_id":"mtp-a0tFKDpMHAUN1Vnt5A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mtp-a0tFKDpMHAUN1Vnt5A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9312524795532227}]},"notebook_case":null}
